cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these materials, please cite the article listed under
  preferred-citation and this repository release.
title: OFTY Glaucoma Suite — Paper 2 repository (historical test materials and revision candidate)
abstract: >-
  Materials for a manuscript on a deterministic rule-based glaucoma
  decision-support suite (OFTY). The repository keeps the historical test
  runner H1 (embedded M5 engine 1.0.0; 23 developer-defined scenarios with
  146 expected assertion instances and 192 combinations checked with five
  predicates) and the descriptive files published at submission, and adds a
  post-submission revision candidate (G2-E) of the M1-M5 source with its
  synthetic test evidence and a reproduction kit. Research prototype; not
  intended or cleared for clinical use; clinical validity and regulatory
  status not established by these tests.
